From b8917e552eaef8947459f4b8a6807f0b19697c9d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ethan Chen <ethan84@andestech.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Aug 2023 14:42:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 070/241] atcrtc100: Support atcrtc100 on AE350

Some functions are not supported in QEMU:
* Alarm Wakeup signal: Not used on FPGA
* Hardware Digital Trimming & Frequency Test: assume RTC clock  is
   accurate in emulation

Signed-off-by: Ethan Chen <ethan84@andestech.com>
